<title>USA: Southwest Securities completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Southwest Securities completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities Group Inc said Thursday it completed its acquisition of the customer assets and independent contractor relationships of the Dallas brokerage firm Cullum &amp; Sandow Securities Inc.</p>
<p>The company declined to disclose the purchase price.</p>
<p>The company said former clients and independent contractors with Cullum &amp; Sandow will receive securities and investment services through its Brokers Transaction Services subsidiary.</p>
</text>
